rect color before they reach you.\n\nSimple to play, but highly addictive \u2013 this game challenges your focus, reaction speed, and hand-eye coordination. As you level up, the speed increases and the color combinations get trickier. Do you have what it takes to become the master of color boxing?", "short_description": "Color-punching boxing action! Punch the incoming balls by matching their colors before they hit you!"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.termsfeed.com/live/3f25982a-7b6e-4386-bc5b-78550e1d9f41", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "SHTechcom", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://sites.google.com/view/vrspeedcolorboxing", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "1592192974313489"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["STANDING", "SITTING"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "29540245795590896"}}]}, "scheduled_offers": {"count": 1, "nodes": [{"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "620247553892428"}]}, "baseline_offer": {"id": "620247553892428"}, "is_approved": true, "firstOffer": {"nodes": [{"start_time": 1746077640, "status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "620247553892428"}]}, "liveChannel": {"nodes": [{"latest_supported_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "id": "29682933144655493", "version": "0.3.0"}, "id": "2002599423605808", "channel_name": "LIVE"}]}, "is_for_oculus_keys_only": false, "primary_binaries": {"nodes": [{"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__